==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|explicare|explicāre|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|explico|explicō|unfold", "to explain|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|explicat|ing}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[explain]] [[meticulous|meticulously]] or in great [[detail]]; to [[elucidate]]; to [[analyze]].
#: ''My homework is to '''explicate''' a poem.''

